# Logs
# Leading slash matters: a bare "logs" matches any directory of that name
# at any depth, and with core.ignorecase=true (the macOS default) it also
# matches "Logs" — which silently swallowed src/pages/Ai/Logs/, so that
# page was never committed and the build failed on its missing import.
/logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
*.zip
